{"version":3,"term":{"cols":164,"rows":36},"timestamp":1790199116,"command":".scripts/demo-remote-cli.sh","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[1.0, "o", "\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m five keystores on this machine stand in for five machines:\r\n\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m   workbench  1d38769d...  and spare ff3e4d38...: both implement orders-db\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m   agent      2e7c93a3...  your agent's machine (alice@example.com)\r\n\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m   observer   7ea9f539...  sec@audit.example: may read the records, may call nothing\r\n\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m   root       the human who signs who's in and what runs where\r\n\u001b[36m[demo]\u001b[0m and a stand-in IdP at http://127.0.0.1:59150 (card 08 swaps in Google).\r\n"]
[5.006, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 1  the admin registers ONE service, and who may call and read it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.505, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires service add orders-db --description … --allow analyst --reader security --host workbench --host spare\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.223, "o", "     service orders-db added (state version 6)\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires serve --check host.json   # how this host implements it; who may call is the state's\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.011, "o", "     host.json ok (version 2)\r\n     trusted issuers:\r\n       http://127.0.0.1:59150  audiences: wires-test-client\r\n     services (who may call each is in the admin-signed state):\r\n       orders-db\r\n         command: sqlite3 -safe -readonly -header -column orders.db\r\n     push: to roles analyst\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires serve host.json   # on the workbench, and on the spare\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.231, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   1: workbench (pid 15661) and spare (pid 15666) serve orders-db, reached by key\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 2  the agent, before signing in: no service listed, and a call is refused\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.508, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires services\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.012, "o", "     wires services: no service allows this node without a login (state v9)\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call orders-db -- 'select count(*) from orders'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.035, "o", "     wires: denied by responder: no ID token presented; run `wires login`; orders-db needs a verified identity in role analyst\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   2: exit 77 -- no verified identity, no sqlite3\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 3  the agent signs in with its IdP -- the token is bound to its node key\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.508, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires login --issuer http://127.0.0.1:59150 --client-id wires-test-client --no-browser\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.144, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires services\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.011, "o", "     orders-db  Read-only SQL (sqlite3) over the orders database; pass the SQL statement as the argument.  (analyst)\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   3: evaluated locally against the signed state: orders-db, because analyst -- no host named\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 3b a signed-in NON-analyst sees nothing -- and asking by name is refused\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.508, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires login …   # on the observer, as sec@audit.example\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.139, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires services\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.006, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call orders-db -- 'select 1'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.03, "o", "     wires: denied by responder: sec@audit.example is in no role allowed to call orders-db (analyst)\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   3b: sec@audit.example sees no orders-db, and naming it anyway gets exit 77 with the reason\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 4  the agent runs SQL by service name -- args, stdin, and MCP\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.507, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call orders-db -- 'select count(*) from orders'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.029, "o", "     count(*)\r\n     --------\r\n            7\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   4a: args call\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ echo 'select customer, sum(total) from orders group by customer order by 2 desc' | wires call orders-db\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.03, "o", "     customer  sum(total)\r\n     --------  ----------\r\n     umbrella       999.0\r\n     globex        329.24\r\n     acme           259.6\r\n     initech         42.0\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   4b: stdin call\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires mcp   # JSON-RPC over pipes: initialize, tools/list, tools/call\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.1, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   4c: MCP tools/call -- the same service, as an MCP tool\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 5  the agent tries to escape the service -- sqlite3 -safe refuses\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.508, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call orders-db -- '.shell id'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.034, "o", "     argv[6]: cannot run .shell in safe mode\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   5: exit 1 from sqlite3 itself\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 6  the reader watches -- every call, from the hosts' own signed logs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.507, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires watch orders-db --once   # on the observer: role security reads orders-db\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.105, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:32:44 orders-db ▶ 7df0 alice@example.com (2e7c…) [analyst] orders-db \"select count(*) from orders\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m     21:32:44 orders-db ■ 7df0 exit 0 · 6 ms · 27 B out · blake3 8b4c…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:32:46 orders-db ■ a7a0 exit 0 · 7 ms · stdin \"select customer, sum(total) from orders group by customer order by 2 desc\" · 126 B out · blake3 5e99…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:32:54 orders-db ■ dc19 exit 1 · 6 ms · 0 B out · blake3 af13…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:32:30 orders-db ✗ 2e7c… orders-db denied: no ID token presented; run `wires login`; orders-db needs a verified identity in role analyst\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:32:39 orders-db ✗ 7ea9… orders-db denied: sec@audit.example is in no role allowed to call orders-db (analyst)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   6a: the reader sees who ran what -- and every refusal -- holding neither end's keys\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires watch --once   # on the agent: not a reader, so only its own calls\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.038, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   6b: the agent sees its own 4 calls and nobody else's\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 7  the workbench pushes to the agent -- by key; the agent exposes nothing\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.508, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires inbox --wait --timeout 1s   # nothing yet\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.275, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires push --to 2e7c93a3… --subject build-41 -- 'failed: test_orders_total'   # on the workbench\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.014, "o", "     queued     alice@example.com (2e7c93a3)  fffe59d1d9fca7e57aca96ac0b1c1466\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires inbox\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.035, "o", "     2026-09-23 21:33:07Z  from host 1d38769d (verified)  build-41  failed: test_orders_total\r\n"]
[0.025, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires inbox --wait --timeout 20s &   then, on the workbench: wires push … build-42\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   7: pushed by key, fetched with no open port; --wait woke on the next one\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "\u001b[1m     2026-09-23 21:33:07Z  from host 1d38769d (verified)  build-41  failed: test_orders_total\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1m     21:33:10 -         ⇢ fffe → alice@example.com (2e7c…) [analyst] \"build-41\" fetched\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 8  the workbench goes down -- the same call is answered by the spare\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.511, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call --verbose orders-db -- 'select count(*) from orders'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.0, "o", "     wires: orders-db answered by host ff3e4d38\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   8: same name, other host -- the agent never named either\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires serve host.json   # the workbench comes back\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] 9  the human removes the agent -- one command, no host restarts\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.512, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires remove agent\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.521, "o", "     removed 2e7c93a3bac68450995b873284befc34d0374e9d578c3acfa2484ee18c8e6b84 (agent) (state version 11, 4 members)\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[2m     $ wires call orders-db -- 'select count(*) from orders'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.043, "o", "     wires: denied by responder: not a member of the current signed state (version 11)\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   9: exit 77, 0 bytes out\r\n"]
[1.041, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   9: and no pushes -- refused at send and at fetch (exit 77)\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "\u001b[32m[ok]\u001b[0m   9: the spare is still pid 15666 -- the removal took effect without a restart\r\n"]
[5.0, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m[demo] SUMMARY\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.516, "o", "     name      : orders-db, a service; its hosts were never named by the caller\r\n     identity  : unverified caller refused (77); alice@example.com allowed as analyst, sec@audit.example refused by name\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     records   : the security reader saw every call and refusal; the agent only its own\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     contained : .shell id refused by sqlite3 -safe, exit 1\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     push      : host -> agent by key, fetched by `wires inbox`; --wait woke on the next\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     failover  : workbench down -> answered by the spare, same command\r\n"]
[0.0, "o", "     revoke    : one `wires remove` -> exit 77, 0 bytes out; pushes refused; 124s wall clock\r\n"]
[0.02, "x", "0"]
